      "t": "A stern assistant arrives at the restaurant to announce that her powerful boss will be dining at Claude Monet tomorrow evening. Knowing that Chef Barinov is in a hospital bed, Vika scrambles to stall the visitor and keep her from marching into the kitchen.",
